{"kind": "finding", "id": "FN-B-alerts-phone-components-2-b-01", "date": "2026-11-26", "lens": "gap-4", "surface": "phone", "area": "phone/components-2", "refs": ["FN-L14-phone-components-2-01", "FN-B-alerts-hq-app-a-04"], "severity": "S3", "title": "MettleUp cannot see whether a member ever read the team's reply to a help question", "what": "When a member opens the reply, the app marks it read only on that phone. Nothing goes back to MettleUp, and HQ's feedback list has no read column. A reply sent to a phone that was reinstalled, erased or swapped, or whose pop-up never came, looks the same in HQ as a reply that was read, so nobody knows to follow up another way.", "expected": "HQ shows for each reply whether the member's app has shown it, and an unread reply after a few days is flagged for a follow-up.", "evidence": ["apps/mobile/src/lib/helpHistoryStore.ts:138-142", "apps/mobile/src/components/feedback/FeedbackButton.tsx:278-284", "apps/mobile/src/components/feedback/HelpQuestions.tsx:62", "deploy/hq/web.js:35"], "proof": "code-read", "root_cause_key": "team-reply-read-never-reaches-hq", "who": "members and the MettleUp team", "how_often": "every team reply", "fix_line": "Send the read moment back with the next reply check and show it on the HQ reply card", "fix_size": "medium", "needs_him": false, "verified": "pending", "status": "open"}
{"kind": "finding", "id": "FN-B-alerts-phone-components-2-b-02", "date": "2026-11-26", "lens": "gap-4", "surface": "phone", "area": "phone/components-2", "refs": [], "severity": "S3", "title": "A help question MettleUp closed without a reply still says the team will reply", "what": "The phone learns only the answer and the replies from the server, never the question's status. If the team closes a question in HQ as done or spam without writing a reply, the member's question keeps saying 'The MettleUp team will reply here.', or after a 'No, it did not help' tap 'We reply as soon as we can', for as long as it is kept. The member waits for a reply that will never come.", "expected": "When a question is closed without a reply, the member's question says so (for example 'Closed by the MettleUp team') instead of promising a reply.", "evidence": ["apps/mobile/src/lib/helpHistory.ts:228-238", "apps/mobile/src/lib/helpHistory.ts:331-335", "apps/mobile/src/lib/helpHistory.ts:86", "deploy/hq/web.js:43-48"], "proof": "code-read", "root_cause_key": "closed-question-still-promises-reply", "who": "members who send a question", "how_often": "every question closed without a reply", "fix_line": "Send the question's closed status with the replies and show a closed line on the phone", "fix_size": "small", "needs_him": false, "verified": "pending", "status": "open"}
{"kind": "finding", "id": "FN-B-alerts-phone-components-2-b-03", "date": "2026-11-26", "lens": "gap-4", "surface": "phone", "area": "phone/components-2", "refs": [], "severity": "S4", "title": "The team-reply pop-up stays in the phone's notification list after the reply was read", "what": "When the member reads the team's reply from the round help button or the Help page, the red dot goes, but the phone's own pop-up about that reply is never taken away. It stays in the notification list looking new until the member swipes it.", "expected": "Reading the reply in the app also clears its pop-up from the notification list.", "evidence": ["apps/mobile/src/lib/helpReplyAlert.ts:18", "apps/mobile/src/lib/helpReplyAlert.ts:57-62", "apps/mobile/src/lib/helpHistoryStore.ts:138-142", "apps/mobile/src/components/feedback/FeedbackButton.tsx:278-284"], "proof": "code-read", "root_cause_key": "read-reply-popup-stays-in-tray", "who": "members with notifications allowed", "how_often": "every team reply read inside the app", "fix_line": "Clear the reply pop-up when the reply is marked read", "fix_size": "small", "needs_him": false, "verified": "pending", "status": "open"}
